{
  "name": "09 · JSON-by-Email Command Center",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Run any workflow by emailing JSON\nEmail yourself (subject starts with `[n8n]`) a JSON body:\n```json\n{\"token\":\"YOUR_SECRET\",\"action\":\"add_lead\",\n \"data\":{\"name\":\"Jane\",\"email\":\"jane@acme.com\",\"message\":\"wants a quote\"}}\n```\nBatch: `\"data\": [ {...}, {...} ]` runs once per entry.\n\nActions → webhooks (edit `routes` in Config):\n`add_lead` 01 · `meeting_brief` 04 · `project_complete` 05 · `research` 10 · `invoice_check` 03-style\n\nSecurity: sender must be in `allowedSenders` **and** token must match (From headers can be spoofed). You get a reply with the result of every call.",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "5a46f517-8439-4ea3-b601-b3fa5e1b3385",
      "name": "About",
